      "body": "Hi @hebasto,\n\nI would like to help contribute to this issue. I have read your comments on adding the O_CLOEXEC (POSIX) and _O_NOINHERIT). And have added the modes in src/util/fs.cpp. \n\nI have tested it in Linux(OpenSUSE distro), but still need to test it in OSX and Windows. But just wanted to check with you to see if the implementation of the PR is headed in the right direction.\n\n[#36677: link to potential fix](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36677)",
